window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>The Ultimate Horror Collection</i> contains unabridged recordings of some of the greatest classic horror stories of all time, including 6 full-length novels and over 50 short stories from nineteenth-and-twentieth-century masters of gothic mystery, horror, fantasy and the macabre, read by a cast of outstanding narrators including Karen Cass, Jonathan Keeble, Peter Noble, Julie Teal and Malk Williams.<br><br>The titles included in this collection, in order of appearance, are:</p><p><br></p><ul><li><i>The Picture of Dorian Grey,</i> by Oscar Wilde (read by Malk Williams)</li><li><i>Carmilla,</i> by Sheridan Le Fanu (read by Karen Cass)</li><li><i>Frankenstein,</i> by Mary Shelley (read by Jonathan Keeble)</li><li><i>The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde, </i>by Robert Louis Stevenson (read by Jonathan Keeble)</li><li><i>The Turn of the Screw,</i> by Henry James (read by Jonathan Keeble and Julie Teal)</li><li><i>Dracula,</i> by Bram Stoker (read by Jonathan Keeble)</li><li><b>12 stories by H.P. Lovecraft</b> - <i>The Colour Out of Space</i>; <i>The Dunwich Horror</i>; <i>The Whisperer in the Darkness</i>; <i>The Haunter of the Dark</i>; <i>Call of Cthulhu</i>; <i>The Rats in the Walls</i>; <i>From Beyond</i>; <i>Dagon;</i> <i>At the Mountains of Madness</i>; <i>In the Vault</i>; <i>The Shadow Over Innsmouth</i>;<i> The Dreams in the Witch House </i>(read by Jonathan Keeble)</li><li><b>14 stories by M.R. James</b> - <i>Canon Alberic’s Scrapbook</i>; <i>Lost Hearts</i>; <i>The Mezzotint</i>; <i>The Ash-tree</i>; <i>Number 13</i>; <i>Casting the Runes</i>; <i>Count Magnus</i>; <i>Oh, Whistle, and I’ll Come to You, My Lad</i>; <i>A Warning to the Curious</i>; <i>A View From a Hill</i>; <i>A Neighbour’s Landmark</i>; <i>The Uncommon Prayer-Book</i>; <i>Wailing Well</i>;<i> The Fenstanton Witch </i>(read by Jonathan Keeble)</li><li><b>30 stories and poems by Edgar Allan Poe</b> - <i>A Descent into The Maelstrom</i>; <i>A Tale of Jerusalem</i>; <i>A Tale of the Ragged Mountain</i>; <i>Eleonora</i>; <i>The Black Cat</i>; <i>The Cask of Amontillado</i>; <i>The Fall of the House of Usher</i>; <i>The Gold Bug</i>; <i>The Hop Frog</i>; <i>The Masque of Red Death</i>; <i>The Murders in Rue Morgue</i>; <i>The Mystery of Marie Roget</i>; <i>The Oblong Box</i>; <i>The Oval Portrait</i>; <i>The Pit and the Pendulum</i>; <i>The Purloined Letter</i>; <i>The Tell-Tale Heart</i>; <i>The Raven</i>; <i>To Helen</i>; <i>Ulalume</i>; <i>A Dream Within a Dream</i>; <i>Annabel Lee</i>; <i>The Haunted Palace</i>; <i>Alone</i>; <i>Dream Land</i>; <i>Eldorado</i>; <i>The City in the Sea</i>; <i>The Bells</i>; <i>A Valentine</i>;<i> A Sonnet to Science </i>(read by Peter Noble and Jonathan Keeble)</li></ul><p><br><br><b>This audiobook is fully indexed. Once downloaded, each book and chapter will be listed so you can easily navigate to the individual section.</b><br></p>"; 
